# xpay Application Roadmap

## Phase 1: Authentication & User Management
- [ ] Implement Google OAuth in `api` backend <!-- id: 4 -->
- [ ] Set up Google Login in `web` frontend <!-- id: 5 -->
- [ ] Expand Prisma schema: `User` model improvements (name, avatar, status) <!-- id: 6 -->
- [ ] Implement Profile Management (view/edit user details) <!-- id: 7 -->

## Phase 2: Wallet System & Razorpay Integration
- [ ] Add `balance` and `transaction` entities to Prisma schema <!-- id: 8 -->
- [ ] Integrate Razorpay for depositing "paper money" <!-- id: 9 -->
- [ ] Implement Withdrawal functionality using Razorpay Payouts (simulated) <!-- id: 10 -->
- [ ] Create Balance display and transaction history in frontend <!-- id: 11 -->

## Phase 3: Money Transfers & QR Payments
- [ ] Implement P2P transfers using Email or Unique User ID <!-- id: 12 -->
- [ ] Add QR Code generation for each user <!-- id: 13 -->
- [ ] Implement QR Code scanning and payment flow <!-- id: 14 -->
- [ ] Real-time transaction notifications (optional but recommended) <!-- id: 15 -->

## Phase 4: Admin Dashboard & Logging
- [ ] Set up Admin roles and permissions <!-- id: 16 -->
- [ ] Implement robust Logging system in backend for audit trails <!-- id: 17 -->
- [ ] Create Admin interface to:
    - [ ] Freeze/Unfreeze accounts <!-- id: 18 -->
    - [ ] Manually adjust user balances <!-- id: 19 -->
    - [ ] View application-wide logs and user activity <!-- id: 20 -->
    - [ ] Handle enquiry listing and responses <!-- id: 21 -->

## Phase 5: Polish & Security
- [ ] Implement proper error handling and centralized logging <!-- id: 22 -->
- [ ] Enhance UI/UX with premium designs and micro-animations <!-- id: 23 -->
- [ ] Security audits for financial transactions and sensitive routes <!-- id: 24 -->
